# Every point below is certified on the same AB carrier through nested
# construction definitions, even when an intermediate line is named BF.
mode prove
triangle A B C
midpoint M B C
perp_bisector p A M
line AB A B
line AC A C
intersection_ll E p AC
intersection_ll F p AB

angle_bisector e_bisector M E F
intersection_ll P e_bisector AB
foot U M AC
foot Q U AB
reflection_point R B A

circumcenter O1 E B A
reflection_point T B O1
circle c1 T Q
intersection_lc_known S AB c1 Q

line BF B F
orthocenter O2 B M E
circle c2 O2 A
intersection_lc_known V AC c2 A
circle c3 V B
intersection_lc_known W BF c3 B

prove_collinear A B F P Q R S W
